WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-US

00:00:01.627 --> 00:00:04.171
The lost and found box.

00:00:04.171 --> 00:00:07.090
Boba? Boba where are you?

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:13.263
Woah... Woah, Cody!

00:00:13.263 --> 00:00:15.557
Help! JJ!

00:00:18.393 --> 00:00:20.270
Welcome to Lost and Found.

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:21.730
Woah.

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:29.446
I'm JJ and I'm
trying to find my bear, Boba.

00:00:31.406 --> 00:00:33.700
We'll find your
bear and get you home.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.786
